ayer hierarchy shown by Origami’s runner render: a full-screen","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"purple canvas, an inset rounded interaction area, and a centered draggable card.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The card maps the ","type":"text"},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" Position output to its SwiftUI offset. A release","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"projects momentum and applies rubber-band bounds. Releasing within 100 points of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"center on both axes pulses Reset, matching the placed graph’s snap-to-origin branch.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"title":"Interaction_DragView"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityAction(action:label:)":{"abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityAction(action:label:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibilityAction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Label","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"action","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"label","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Label","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"accessibilityAction(action:label:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilityaction(action:label:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","kind":"symbol","title":"Swami","type":"topic","role":"collection"}}}